      "sc:description": "ST2HE is a generative framework that synthesizes virtual Hematoxylin and Eosin (H&E) images directly from High-resolution Spatial Transcriptomics (HR-ST) data. It enables histologically informative image generation, bridging the gap between molecular data and tissue pathology for enhanced annotation.",
